<title>USA: Environmental starts filing 10-Ks.</title>
<headline>Environmental starts filing 10-Ks.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Environmental Safeguards Inc said on Friday it has filed its first 10-KSB form with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>The company said that becoming subject to this reporting requirement is a milestone in its development.</p>
<p>Environmental Safeguards is a recycler and remediator of hydrocarbon and hydrocarbon derivative contaminated soil.</p>
